{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>各位貓奴注意！去福岡旅遊又有必訪的神社打卡點！位於福岡縣八女市、以祈求良緣與除厄聞名的「福島八幡宮」，先前大受歡迎的超人氣福貓御守宣佈重新開始頒布！這款御守設計特別採用圓滾滾的小貓背影剪影，搭配溫柔的水彩風配色。更貼心地一口氣推出6種不同毛色款式，有黑白貓、橘貓、灰貓以及經典三色貓等，讓大家可以根據自家主子的毛色精準挑選！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179164803525367066_12140987826aca6124bf302.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179164803896241829_7631318846aca61278c335.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179164804095525784_17687178806aca61296f8bd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179164804280857270_7695652496aca612b4221e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179164804458091000_5448345446aca612d0f6a5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T16:18:11.272639+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}